  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Bernardinus de Scottis dat Thomae de Pagliaresi agrum frumentarium situm in plano Sancti Petri in Campo, et accipit in commutatione agrum in contrata Fontebranda cum iure irrigationis et accessus, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc commutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum commutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Petrus de Salimbenis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Guidottus filius Rainerii</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ildebrandinus de Malavoltis</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
